          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "*CD259544564200*\nAs a holder of a vast collection of documents on this phenomenon in various formats,\nit is considered, among the nations of the modern world, one of the most prolific in recording,\ncataloging, and classifying UFO-related information. As a result of the work of Brazilian ufologists, some of this information has already been made available to the National Archive, such as the reports of the System for the Investigation of Unidentified Aerial Objects (SIOANI), which operated from 1969 to 1972, and part of the archives of Operation Prato (1977 to 1978), both",
